  "reference": "1 Mihayo Ya Shikū 16",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūfunya shitambò kūlwa būyegi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū būlīshikīlīja ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu, būlītūūla ū ng'wiheema īlo walī walībeegeja ū Daūdi. Hanuma ya henaho būmfunīja ū Mulungu shitambo sha kūpemva na shakwinha sha būsangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho wamala ū kūfunya ī shitambo sha kūpemva nī shakwinha sha būsangī, ūbalombela mbango a banhū mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna pye a Baisilaeli, bagosha na bakīma, būlī ng'wene winhwa nū Daūdi shipande sha ngatī, keki ya nhende, na keki ya mizabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ūbasola bamò ba Balawī kūbiza batūmami kū būtongi w'iheema lya ng'wa SEEBA: kūyūlombela banhū, kūlūmba, na kūngongoola SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilalei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntongeeji wabo walī Asafu, wa kabīlī Zakalia, hūna ūlondeela Yeieli, Shemilamoti, Yehieli, Maatisia, Eliabu, Benaiya, Obedi-edomu, na Yeieli. A benabo ū nīmo gwabo gwalī kūtūla malimba na ndono; ū Asafu ū nīmo gwakwe gwalī kūlīja nzege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji a ba Benaya nū Yahazieli baalī na nīmo gwa kūfuula mhembe, būlī gwa ū kū būtongi w'isandīko lya būlagane wa ng'wa Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lyīmbo lya būlūmbi wa ng'wa Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo ū Daūdi ūnagīja ū Asafu na a bīmbi biye gīkī ī lyīmbo lya kūnūmba SEEBA īlī lyīmve: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkumīlījagi ū SEEBA, na lombagi mu lina lyakwe; bakumūkījagi a banhū ba mahanga īyo wīyītile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wīmbīlagi we, īmbagi mīmbo ga kūnkumīlīja; shikumūchagi ī shītwa shakwe shose pye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yegelagi mu lina lyakwe lyeela, ī ng'holò ja banhū abo bakūnkoobaga SEEBA jisangabale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wisagīlagwi SEEBA hamò nū būdūla wakwe, būkoobagi ū būshū wakwe būlī makanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yizūkagwi ī ya kūkumya īyo wīyīītile, īyo īlī ya kūkaamaaja, nū būlamuji wakwe ūbo wabūfunije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee bing'we shibyalīlwe sha ntūmami wakwe Isilaeli, Bing'we bitūnja ba ng'wa Yakobo abo mulī basolwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei hū ng'wene ū SEEBA Mulungu wise, a kalamulīle kakwe kalī hose pyī ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lilagane lyakwe lyizūkagwi shikū jose welelo na weleo, ū mhayo ūyo agūlagīlile, kūshisha shibyalīlwe shihūmbī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lilagane īlo akabeeja nū Abulahamu, ī shilahīlo īsho akang'wilahīlīla Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūlī Yakobo ūshiinha nguzu shūbiza shilagīlo, ū kūlī Isilaeli lyūbiza ilagane lya welelo bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya, “Nakūkwinha bebe ī sī ya Kanaani, ū gwenūyo hū gūkūbiza ngabo gwa wingīji wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikū jene baalī bataalī bageehu no ū būkūmi wabo; baalī bageehu no, hama bikalaga moi gītī bageni dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikalaga bakūyūngaga kūfuma ihanga īlī kūja kū līngī, kūfuma būtemi ūbū kūja kū būtemi būngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atanekelile nūūlū ūmò wa kūbiboneela, na a batemi wabahamaga kūlwa kūbagunīja a boi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya gīkī, “Mutizūbakuumya a babilwa maguta bane, yaya ū kūbīītīla yabūbi a bahangi bane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we banhū ba mu sī jose ng'wīmbīlagi ū SEEBA; būlī lūshikū īlomeelagi ī ya būpīji wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Līkumūchagi ī likūjo lyakwe ū mu mahanga, ī shītwa shakwe sha kūkumya shimanīke kū banhū bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA alī ntaale, na igeleelilwe kūkumīlījiwa, igeleelilwe kogohwa kūtinda bamulungu bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno pye a bamulungu ba mahanga balī mashiikolile dūhū, alīyo ū SEEBA hū ng'wene ū nseemi w'igūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikūjo na magaka shimpīdije we, ū mu wikalo wakwe būlīmo būdūla na būyegi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we ng'anda jose ja mu sī, ng'winhagi ū SEEBA, ng'winhagi ikūjo ū SEEBA gīkī igeleelilwe ikūjo na nguzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'winhagi ū SEEBA ī likūjo īlo lyigeleelilwe kū lina lyakwe. Enhagi shakwinha, ng'wegeele kū būtongi wakwe; Namyagi ū SEEBA mu wiza ūbo wigeleelilwe weela wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banhū bose ba mu sī detemagi ū kū būtongi wakwe. Ī sī īlang'hanilwe mu būdūla būtaale, ītīko kūsegejiwa aho īlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ligūlū ni līyegage, nī sī īzalabane; ū mu mahanga bahaye gīkī, “Ū SEEBA hū ng'wene ū nsugi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nyanza īhuuyembe, nī shose īsho shilī muyo, a malaale nago gayege, nī ī shose īsho shilīmo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mitī ya mu bū īkwīmba, īkwīmba na būyegi ū kū būtongi wa ng'wa SEEBA; nguno aliza kwīlamula ī sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkumīlījagi ū SEEBA, nguno alī wawiza, īkī ī Kīgongo chakwe shilī sha welelo na welelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīlīlagi gīkī, “Tūpījage SEEBA mpīja wise, tūkumingage ūtūpīje ū kūfuma ū mu mahanga, tūpandīke kūlīkumīlīja ī lina lyako lyeela; tūpandīke kūlīyegela ī likūjo lyako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akumīlījiwe ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, kūfuma welelo na kūshisha welelo bose. Hūna a banhū bose būhaya; “Alichene, SEEBA akumīlījiwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūneka ū Asafu na a biye kū būtongi w'isandīko lya būlagane wa ng'wa SEEBA, gīkī abize wa kūyūbeeja būlī milīmo īyo yalī yigelile kwītwa būlī lūshikū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū Obedi-edomu ūneka henaho, hamò na a biye abo makūmi atandatū, būbiza batūmami ba henaho. Ū ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Yedusuni, Obedi-edomu walang'hanaga na ha nyango, hamò nū Hosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūneka ū ngabīji Sadoki na a bagabīji biye kwiheema lya ng'wa SEEBA īlo lyalī kwipandī lya higūlya lya Gibeoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gīkī bayūmfunīja ū SEEBA shakwinha sha kūpemva būlī lūshikjū, dilū na mhīndī, a ha ng'walīlo gwa shakwinha sha kūpemva, kūlenganīla nī yose īyo yandīkilwe mu shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA, īsho walī wabinha a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakalekwa hamò nabo ba Hemani na Yedusuni, na a bose abo baalī basolwa; abo baalī bahelilwe mu mina gabo kūlwa nīmo gwa kūnkumīlīja SEEBA, “īkī ū būtogwa wakwe būlī wa būja na būja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nīmo gwa ba Hemani nū Yedusuni gwalī kūfuula mhembe na kūlīja nzege, nī shingī īsho shaalījiagwa h'ikanza lya kwīmba mīmbo meela. A bitūnja ba ng'wa Yedusuni baalī balang'hani ba ha mita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho a banhū a bose būsambaala, būlī bene būja kaya; ū Daūdi nang'hwe ūshoka kū ng'wakwe kwīfuuha mbango ī kaya yakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
